# format:
# - case inensitive
# - title line: "TITLE <tone-seq-name> <initial-octave>
# - tone sequence items:
#     C D E F G A B         : pitches in scientific pitch notation (SPN), in current octave
#     Cn Dn En Fn Gn An Bn  : pitches in SPN, where 'n' is the octave number, e.g. C4
#     do re mi fa sol la ti : solfege syllables, do=C re=D, ...
#     <n> up down           : set octave to 'n'; or increase / decrease octave
#     pause1 pause2 pause4  : delay for 250, 500, 1000 ms
# - an implicit pause2 is appended to the end of each line of items

TITLE ttls 5
C C G G A A G
F F E E D D C
G G F F E E D
G G F F E E D
C C G G A A G
F F E E D D C

TITLE mary 5
E D C D E E E
D D D
E G G
E D C D E E E E D D E D C 

TITLE fj 5
C D E C pause1 C D E C
E F G pause1 E F G
G A G F E C pause1 G A G F E C
C G C pause1 C G C

TITLE jbells 4
E E E pause1 E E E
E G C D E
F F F F F E E
E D D E D pause1 G
E E E pause1 E E E
E G C D E
F F F F F E E
G G F D C

TITLE alphabet 5
C C G G A A G
F F E E D D C
G G F F E E D
G G F F E E D
C C G G A A G
F F E E D D C 

TITLE ce3k 5
D E C C4 G4 pause2
D E C C4 G4

TITLE doremi4 4
C D E F G A B

TITLE doremi5 5
do re mi fa sol la ti

